      "treatment_summary": "Immune therapy at SCT: prednisolone + ruxolitinib + anakinra. αβTCR/CD19-depleted allo-HSCT at age 23 (Table 1 'Age') from a MUD 9/10 donor after ATG, fludarabine, thiotepa and melphalan myeloablative conditioning (cohort regimen); post-SCT MMF + prednisolone + ruxolitinib + anakinra, disease-associated immunosuppression tapered only after MMF stopped at day 28; letermovir prophylaxis until day 100; no prophylactic DLI because of active transplant-associated immunosuppression. Engraftment at 11 days; donor chimerism 100% T cell / 100% non-T cell; IDDA 92 at baseline, 24 at 1 year after SCT; follow-up 17 months; vaccination regimen not yet completed at data cut-off.",
